    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "473 1  Definitions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-473"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\naccess in relation to material includes:\n\n(a) the display of the material by a computer or any other output\nof the material from a computer; or\n\n(b) the copying or moving of the material to any place in a\ncomputer or to a data storage device; or\n\n(c) in the case of material that is a program—the execution of the\nprogram.\naccount identifier means:\n\n(a) something that:\n\n(i) contains subscription-specific secure data; and\n\n(ii) is installed, or capable of being installed, in a mobile\ntelecommunications device; or\n\n(b) anything else that:\n\n(i) allows a particular mobile telecommunications account\nto be identified; and\n\n(ii) is prescribed by the regulations as an account identifier\nfor the purposes of this Part.\nNote:\nParagraph (a)—This would include a SIM card.\n\nTelecommunications offences  Schedule 1",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part:\naccess in relation to material includes:\n\n(a) the display of the material by a computer or any other output\nof the material from a computer; or\n\n(b) the copying or moving of the material to any place in a\ncomputer or to a data storage device; or\n\n(c) in the case of material that is a program—the execution of the\nprogram.\naccount identifier means:\n\n(a) something that:\n\n(i) contains subscription-specific secure data; and\n\n(ii) is installed, or capable of being installed, in a mobile\ntelecommunications device; or\n\n(b) anything else that:\n\n(i) allows a particular mobile telecommunications account\nto be identified; and\n\n(ii) is prescribed by the regulations as an account identifier\nfor the purposes of this Part.\nNote:\nParagraph (a)—This would include a SIM card.\n\nTelecommunications offences  Schedule 1",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fd7266ad2afd51c393ae0f1c2b31bd353b79802b18f697b1afb7cfe6ebcb2ccc",
      "skos:note": "Defines access in relation to material, account identifier, and execution of a program."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-473",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "473 1  Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\naccess in relation to material includes:\n\n(a) the display of the material by a computer or any other output\nof the material from a computer; or\n\n(b) the copying or moving of the material to any place in a\ncomputer or to a data storage device; or\n\n(c) in the case of material that is a program—the execution of the\nprogram.\naccount identifier means:\n\n(a) something that:\n\n(i) contains subscription-specific secure data; and\n\n(ii) is installed, or capable of being installed, in a mobile\ntelecommunications device; or\n\n(b) anything else that:\n\n(i) allows a particular mobile telecommunications account\nto be identified; and\n\n(ii) is prescribed by the regulations as an account identifier\nfor the purposes of this Part.\nNote:\nParagraph (a)—This would include a SIM card.\n\nTelecommunications offences  Schedule 1"
    },
    {
