    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "473 3  Producing, supplying or obtaining data or material in the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-473-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "form of data\n\nA reference in this Part to a person producing, supplying or\nobtaining data, or material that is in the form of data, includes a\nreference to the person:\n\n(a) producing, supplying or obtaining data held or contained in a\ncomputer or data storage device; or\n\n(b) producing, supplying or obtaining a document in which the\ndata is recorded.",
      "skos:definition": "form of data\n\nA reference in this Part to a person producing, supplying or\nobtaining data, or material that is in the form of data, includes a\nreference to the person:\n\n(a) producing, supplying or obtaining data held or contained in a\ncomputer or data storage device; or\n\n(b) producing, supplying or obtaining a document in which the\ndata is recorded.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-473-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c87e7a2e74c51c06dcdc65b3ffd6d8ad3590558e181d49e626324ef33fba3dfb",
      "skos:note": "Producing, supplying or obtaining data or material in the form of data is required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-473-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "473 3  Producing, supplying or obtaining data or material in the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "form of data\n\nA reference in this Part to a person producing, supplying or\nobtaining data, or material that is in the form of data, includes a\nreference to the person:\n\n(a) producing, supplying or obtaining data held or contained in a\ncomputer or data storage device; or\n\n(b) producing, supplying or obtaining a document in which the\ndata is recorded."
    },
