      "skos:definition": "(1) A person is guilty of an offence if the person does anything with\nthe intention of dishonestly obtaining a gain from a carriage service\nprovider by way of the supply of a carriage service.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 5 years.\nCausing a loss",
      "values:partOf": {
