    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-2-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474(3) 2  General dishonesty with respect to a carriage service provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-2-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person is guilty of an offence if:\n\n(a) the person dishonestly causes a loss, or dishonestly causes a\nrisk of loss, to a carriage service provider in connection with\nthe supply of a carriage service; and\n\n(b) the person knows or believes that the loss will occur or that\nthere is a substantial risk of the loss occurring.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 5 years.\n\nTelecommunications offences  Schedule 1",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A person is guilty of an offence if:\n\n(a) the person dishonestly causes a loss, or dishonestly causes a\nrisk of loss, to a carriage service provider in connection with\nthe supply of a carriage service; and\n\n(b) the person knows or believes that the loss will occur or that\nthere is a substantial risk of the loss occurring.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 5 years.\n\nTelecommunications offences  Schedule 1",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
