    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474 3  Person acting for a carrier or carriage service provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carrier, or on behalf of persons at least one of\nwhom is a carrier, is, in respect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carrier.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carriage service provider, or on behalf of\npersons at least one of whom is a carriage service provider, is, in\nrespect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carriage service provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carrier, or on behalf of persons at least one of\nwhom is a carrier, is, in respect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carrier.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carriage service provider, or on behalf of\npersons at least one of whom is a carriage service provider, is, in\nrespect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carriage service provider.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "da781b5bbf2615492bed612a7343ecabaa4642b58663bd8f5ff4b10056117eeb"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474 3  Person acting for a carrier or carriage service provider",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carrier, or on behalf of persons at least one of\nwhom is a carrier, is, in respect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carrier.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carriage service provider, or on behalf of\npersons at least one of whom is a carriage service provider, is, in\nrespect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carriage service provider."
    },
    {
