    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474(2) 3  Person acting for a carrier or carriage service provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carriage service provider, or on behalf of\npersons at least one of whom is a carriage service provider, is, in\nrespect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carriage service provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carriage service provider, or on behalf of\npersons at least one of whom is a carriage service provider, is, in\nrespect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carriage service provider.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c411985a6f441a90856d80354e234a404dcd4299a0d9fc4f95ac4de74d13fc7c",
      "skos:note": "A person acting for a carrier or carriage service provider is liable for certain actions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474(2) 3  Person acting for a carrier or carriage service provider",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person who does any thing\nfor or on behalf of a carriage service provider, or on behalf of\npersons at least one of whom is a carriage service provider, is, in\nrespect of:\n\n(a) the doing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(b) any rental, fee or charge payable for or in relation to the\ndoing by that person of that thing; or\n\n(c) the operation by that person of a facility in connection with\nthe doing of that thing; or\n\n(d) a facility belonging to that person; or\n\n(e) the operation by that person of a satellite;\ntaken to be a carriage service provider."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-3-ss-2-norm",
