      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person is guilty of an offence if:\n\n(a) a communication is in the course of telecommunications\ncarriage; and\n\n(b) the person causes the communication to be received by a\nperson or carriage service other than the person or service to\nwhom it is directed.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) A wrongful delivery of communications is an anomaly if it deviates from the intended recipient."
    },
