        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of an offence against subsection (5), absolute\nliability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the\noffence, that the carriage service is supplied by a carriage service\nprovider.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of an offence against subsection (5), absolute\nliability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the\noffence, that the carriage service is supplied by a carriage service\nprovider.",
