      "skos:note": "Absolute liability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474(6) 6  Interference with facilities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of an offence against subsection (5), absolute\nliability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the\noffence, that the carriage service is supplied by a carriage service\nprovider."
    },
