    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474(8) 6  Interference with facilities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of this section, a facility is taken to be owned or\noperated by a nominated carrier if the Telecommunications Act\n1997 applies, under section 81A of that Act, as if that facility were\nowned or operated by the nominated carrier.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) For the purposes of this section, a facility is taken to be owned or\noperated by a nominated carrier if the Telecommunications Act\n1997 applies, under section 81A of that Act, as if that facility were\nowned or operated by the nominated carrier.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-6"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5e550837304b4ece24f2c5a29a503e5fd0fc7149e4f1c5c4c38e28c719d3123a",
      "skos:note": "Facilities are taken to be owned or operated by a nominated carrier under the Telecommunications Act 1997."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474(8) 6  Interference with facilities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of this section, a facility is taken to be owned or\noperated by a nominated carrier if the Telecommunications Act\n1997 applies, under section 81A of that Act, as if that facility were\nowned or operated by the nominated carrier."
    },
    {
