      "skos:note": "Modifying or interfering with a telecommunications device identifier is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-7-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474(1) 7  Modification etc. of a telecommunications device identifier",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 21,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is guilty of an offence if the person:\n\n(a) modifies a telecommunications device identifier; or\n\n(b) interferes with the operation of a telecommunications device\nidentifier.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years."
    },
