      "values:originalText": "(2) A person may be found guilty of an offence against subsection (1)\neven if committing the offence against subsection 474.7(1)\n(modification of a telecommunications device identifier) is\nimpossible.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A person may be found guilty of an offence against subsection (1)\neven if committing the offence against subsection 474.7(1)\n(modification of a telecommunications device identifier) is\nimpossible.",
