      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(3) It is not an offence to attempt to commit an offence against\nsubsection (1).\nDefences",
      "skos:definition": "(3) It is not an offence to attempt to commit an offence against\nsubsection (1).\nDefences",
      "values:partOf": {
