      "cml:integrityHash": "b6d63b9ff40e8bae7666144e7c209bc0b53d8cbead9dedcd94c9127b07753bb6",
      "skos:note": "Using a carriage service to transmit a communication with the intention of procuring someone under 16 to engage in sexual activity is an offence."
