        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(8) A person may be found guilty of an offence against section 474.26\nor 474.27 even if it is impossible for the sexual activity referred to\nin that section to take place.\nFictitious recipient",
      "skos:definition": "(8) A person may be found guilty of an offence against section 474.26\nor 474.27 even if it is impossible for the sexual activity referred to\nin that section to take place.\nFictitious recipient",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d7011f45bc17a5ed03b39f98dc04f83a553ea9186e340876e2742b853aae166c",
      "skos:note": "Guilty of an offence against section 474.26 or 474.27 even if impossible for the sexual activity to take place."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474(8) 27(2)(c) or (3)(f) was represented to the sender as being:",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 42,
      "values:originalText": "(8) A person may be found guilty of an offence against section 474.26\nor 474.27 even if it is impossible for the sexual activity referred to\nin that section to take place.\nFictitious recipient"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
