    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474(11) 27(2)(c) or (3)(f) was represented to the sender as being:",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(11) In sections 474.26 and 474.27 and this section:\nprocure a person to engage in sexual activity includes:\n\n(a) encourage, entice or recruit the person to engage in that\nactivity; or\n\n(b) induce the person (whether by threats, promises or otherwise)\nto engage in that activity.\nsexual activity means:\n\n(a) sexual intercourse as defined in section 50AC of the Crimes\nAct 1914; or\n\n(b) an act of indecency as defined in section 50AB of that Act; or\n\n(c) any other activity of a sexual or indecent nature that involves\nthe human body, or bodily actions or functions.\nThe activity referred to in paragraph (c) need not involve physical\ncontact between people.",
      "skos:definition": "(11) In sections 474.26 and 474.27 and this section:\nprocure a person to engage in sexual activity includes:\n\n(a) encourage, entice or recruit the person to engage in that\nactivity; or\n\n(b) induce the person (whether by threats, promises or otherwise)\nto engage in that activity.\nsexual activity means:\n\n(a) sexual intercourse as defined in section 50AC of the Crimes\nAct 1914; or\n\n(b) an act of indecency as defined in section 50AB of that Act; or\n\n(c) any other activity of a sexual or indecent nature that involves\nthe human body, or bodily actions or functions.\nThe activity referred to in paragraph (c) need not involve physical\ncontact between people.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-descriptionlogic-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3822a06a7b8615732394081dabe18d9397871f4cd18e4f28bf2526e05f40fa08",
      "skos:note": "Prohibits certain actions related to sexual activity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11",
