      "cml:premiseText": "sexual activity means:\n\n(a) sexual intercourse as defined in section 50AC of the Crimes\nAct 1914; or\n\n(b) an act of indecency as defined in section 50AB of that Act; or\n\n(c) any other activity of a sexual or indecent nature that involves\nthe human body, or bodily actions or functions."
    },
