        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(11) In sections 474.26 and 474.27 and this section:\nprocure a person to engage in sexual activity includes:\n\n(a) encourage, entice or recruit the person to engage in that\nactivity;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits the induction of individuals for sexual activity.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(11) In sections 474.26 and 474.27 and this section:\nprocure a person to engage in sexual activity includes:\n\n(b) induce the person (whether by threats, promises or otherwise)\nto engage in that activity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits physical contact between individuals for certain activities.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The activity referred to in paragraph (c) need not involve physical\ncontact between people."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-11-logic-descriptionlogic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines what constitutes an act of indecency.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "sexual activity means:\n\n(a) sexual intercourse as defined in section 50AC of the Crimes\nAct 1914; or\n\n(b) an act of indecency as defined in section 50AB of that Act;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-34",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474 29  Defences to offences against section 474.26 or 474.27",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-34"
      },
