    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-36",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474 30  Defences for NRS employees and emergency call persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-36"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.44",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is not criminally responsible for an offence against a\nprovision of this Subdivision in relation to particular conduct if the\nperson:\n\n(a) is an employee of the NRS provider; and\n\n(b) engages in the conduct in good faith in the course of the\nperson’s duties as such an employee.\n\n(2) A person is not criminally responsible for an offence against a\nprovision of this Subdivision in relation to particular conduct if the\nperson:\n\n(a) is an emergency call person; and\n\n(b) engages in the conduct in good faith in the course of the\nperson’s duties as such an emergency call person.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person is not criminally responsible for an offence against a\nprovision of this Subdivision in relation to particular conduct if the\nperson:\n\n(a) is an employee of the NRS provider; and\n\n(b) engages in the conduct in good faith in the course of the\nperson’s duties as such an employee.\n\n(2) A person is not criminally responsible for an offence against a\nprovision of this Subdivision in relation to particular conduct if the\nperson:\n\n(a) is an emergency call person; and\n\n(b) engages in the conduct in good faith in the course of the\nperson’s duties as such an emergency call person.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-36-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-36-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b24e2a069d92511cf205d3509ab994805a12f56a8666988f59d2a5824d6d3cf9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-36",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "474 30  Defences for NRS employees and emergency call persons",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is not criminally responsible for an offence against a\nprovision of this Subdivision in relation to particular conduct if the\nperson:\n\n(a) is an employee of the NRS provider; and\n\n(b) engages in the conduct in good faith in the course of the\nperson’s duties as such an employee.\n\n(2) A person is not criminally responsible for an offence against a\nprovision of this Subdivision in relation to particular conduct if the\nperson:\n\n(a) is an emergency call person; and\n\n(b) engages in the conduct in good faith in the course of the\nperson’s duties as such an emergency call person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-36-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "474(1) 30  Defences for NRS employees and emergency call persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/act#sch-1-sec-474-36-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
