      "values:originalText": "Omit “Part VIIB of the Crimes Act 1914”, substitute “Part 10.6 of the\nCriminal Code”.\nNote:\nThe heading to subsection 11D(4) is replaced by the heading “Part 10.6 of the Criminal\nCode”."
    },
