      },
      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.63",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by item 1 applies to prosecutions brought after\nthe commencement of that item.\n\nOther amendments of the Criminal Code  Schedule 4",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by item 1 applies to prosecutions brought after\nthe commencement of that item.\n\nOther amendments of the Criminal Code  Schedule 4",
