      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(a) the person engages in conduct; and\n\n(aa) as a result of that conduct, the person obtains a financial\nadvantage for another person from a third person; and\n\n(ab) the person knows or believes that the other person is not\neligible to receive that financial advantage; and\n\nOther amendments of the Criminal Code  Schedule 4\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act (No. 2) 2004                    59",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(a) the person engages in conduct; and\n\n(aa) as a result of that conduct, the person obtains a financial\nadvantage for another person from a third person; and\n\n(ab) the person knows or believes that the other person is not\neligible to receive that financial advantage; and\n\nOther amendments of the Criminal Code  Schedule 4\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act (No. 2) 2004                    59",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
