      "dc:source": "act.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "Division 2 aircraft)\nRepeal the subparagraph, substitute:\n\n(i) engaged in a flight in the course of trade and commerce\nwith other countries or among the States; or\n\n(ia) engaged in a flight within a Territory, between 2\nTerritories or between a State and a Territory; or",
      "skos:definition": "Division 2 aircraft)\nRepeal the subparagraph, substitute:\n\n(i) engaged in a flight in the course of trade and commerce\nwith other countries or among the States; or\n\n(ia) engaged in a flight within a Territory, between 2\nTerritories or between a State and a Territory; or",
